SUMMARY:🛡️ Buy travel insurance + passport validity check
DESCRIPTION:09:00 local\, wherever you are.\nWHY NOW\, not 'before depart
 ure': trip-cancellation cover excludes anything already announced or occ
 urred when you buy. Every week you wait is a week an exclusion can cryst
 allise.\nDO:\n1. Buy medical + evacuation cover for 2 adults\, 2026-11-2
 0 → 2026-11-29.\n2. Destination picker must read China (mainland) — 
 NOT Hong Kong\, NOT Macau.\n3. Altitude: the policy must cover 4\,680 m.
  Many cap trekking at 3\,000 or 4\,000 m\; Yulong Glacier Park is above 
 both. If it caps out\, buy the extension or cancel the day-6 cable car (
 checklist row 10).\n4. If you intend to ride at Lashihai on day 7\, hors
 e riding needs a NAMED high-risk extension.\n5. Check both passports are
  valid to at least 2027-05-29 (six months past return).\n6. Re-read the 
 Chinese Embassy Canberra visa-free notice: https://au.china-embassy.gov.
 cn/eng/tzgg/202511/t20251105_11747334.htm\nAFTER: save the issued policy
  SCHEDULE (not the product page) to your phone — the waiting period\, 
 deductible\, payout ratio and assistance hotline are only on it.\nIF IT 
 FAILS: a policy that will not cover 4\,680 m is not a reason to skip ins
 urance — buy the medical cover and drop the glacier cable car instead.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: buy travel insurance (altitude 4\,680 m + China mai
 nland)
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Now: buy travel insurance\, check passport validity
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
