SUMMARY:✈️ Book SYD→KMG and LJG→SYD
DESCRIPTION:09:00 local\, wherever you are.\nTARGET: A$1\,243 for 2\, Chi
 na Southern\, dep SYD 15:15 Fri 2026-11-20 → arr KMG 09:45 Sat 11-21 (
 1 stop\, 21 h 30).\nhttps://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=One+way+flig
 hts+from+SYD+to+KMG+on+2026-11-20+for+2+adults\nRETURN — this one was 
 never priced: https://www.google.com/travel/flights?q=One+way+flights+fr
 om+LJG+to+SYD+on+2026-11-28+for+2+adults\nBook LJG→SYD as ONE ticket e
 nd to end. Two separate tickets meeting at Guangzhou tag your bag only t
 o Guangzhou and put you landside to re-check it.\nDO NOT take the A$1\,1
 19 fare that lands 21:30 — it is A$124 cheaper and deletes day 1.\nCHE
 CK: checked-bag allowance on the fare you pick\, before comparing prices
 .\nFALLBACK if LJG→SYD is absurd: fly or take the train Lijiang→Kunm
 ing on 11-28 morning and use KMG→SYD 22:35 (A$1\,030 for 2\, verified 
 2026-08-29) — separate tickets\, so allow ≥4 h at Kunming.\nLINKED: 
 day 8's whole timeline is built on an assumed 13:30 take-off. Once booke
 d\, tell the planner the real time.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: book the Yunnan flights
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Now: book SYD→KMG and LJG→SYD
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
