SUMMARY:🚄 12306 opens: Kunming → Dali (day 3\, 11-23)
DESCRIPTION:11:00 Sydney = 08:00 China. Sales open exactly 15 days ahead 
 and are released in station batches through the China day (08:00–18:00
 ).\nBEFORE the alarm: your 12306 account must already be registered agai
 nst the passport number — first-time foreign registration sometimes ne
 eds a one-off verification at a station window\, which you cannot do fro
 m Sydney.\nhttps://www.12306.cn/en/\nBOOK: Kunming Railway Station 昆
 明站 → Dali Railway Station 大理站\, 2nd class\, 2 adults\, morni
 ng departure around 10:15 (≈2 h 05\, ≈¥145 pp).\nNAME must match th
 e passport exactly — a mismatch is refused at the gate\, not fixed on 
 the platform.\nIF THE CARD IS REJECTED: Trip.com resells the same seat w
 ith a small fee and takes any card.\nIF THE MORNING TRAINS ARE GONE: tak
 e any departure before 13:00 — day 3 has slack\; after that the Dali e
 vening block dies.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow 11:00: 12306 opens for Kunming→Dali
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:30 min: 12306 opens for Kunming→Dali (11-23)
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
