SUMMARY:🚄 12306 opens: Dali → Lijiang (day 5\, 11-25)
DESCRIPTION:11:00 Sydney = 08:00 China. Same 15-day clock as the 11-08 ga
 te.\nhttps://www.12306.cn/en/\nBOOK: Dali Railway Station 大理站 → 
 Lijiang Railway Station 丽江站\, 2nd class\, 2 adults\, around 10:45 
 (≈1 h 55\, ≈¥70 pp).\nLate November is Yunnan's low season so this 
 leg should not be tight — but the passport number is the ticket.\nIF I
 T IS FULL: the Xiaguan→Lijiang express coach does it in ~3 h and needs
  no pre-sale\, but it lands you at the new-town terminal.
