SUMMARY:📋 Two-weeks-out re-check (hours\, fees\, payments\, eSIM)
DESCRIPTION:09:00 local\, wherever you are. Every opening hour and fee in
  the plan is a seasonal PATTERN captured 2026-08-29 — nobody publishes
  late-November hours in August. This is where they become facts.\nRE-REA
 D\, in this order:\n1. Yulong Snow Mountain reservation rules — they c
 hanged twice in 2026. Confirm the 7-day / 20:00 China release and that t
 he glacier cable car is ¥140. https://www.ylxs.com.cn/\n2. Winter hours
 : many Yunnan sites switch around 16 November\, mid-trip. Stone Forest (
 07:30–18:00)\, Three Pagodas (08:30–17:30)\, Mu Palace (last entry ~
 17:30)\, Yuantong Temple (~18:00).\n3. Fees marked est: Stone Forest ¥1
 30+¥25\, Wangu Tower ¥50\, Mu Palace ¥60\, Baisha ¥30\, Shuhe (free?
 )\, Lashihai boat.\n4. Lijiang old-town maintenance fee — still ¥50 p
 p\, 365-day validity?\nALSO TODAY:\n5. Bind a Visa/Mastercard in BOTH Al
 ipay and WeChat Pay and test each with a small top-up. WeChat must be re
 al-name verified before the 11-19 gate or you cannot buy the cable car a
 t all.\n6. Buy and install the roaming eSIM (NOT a China SIM — a local
  SIM sits inside the firewall).\n7. Download Amap 高德\, Organic Maps 
 + the trip.kml\, an Apple Translate offline pack\, DiDi.\nIF SOMETHING H
 AS MOVED: the day it breaks is named on that day's card under 'running l
 ate'.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow: two-weeks-out re-check of every hour and fee
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Now: re-check hours/fees\, test Alipay + WeChat Pay\, install
  the eSIM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
