SUMMARY:🏔️ Yulong glacier cable car — booking opens (for 11-26)
DESCRIPTION:23:00 Sydney = 20:00 China. Released 7 days ahead\, real-name
  against the passport.\nONLY the official WeChat mini-programs sell it: 
 玉龙雪山服务 and 丽江旅游集团. No third party is authorised 
 — anything else is a resale at a markup\, and some are not tickets at 
 all.\nBUY: 2 adults — ¥100 entry + ¥20 eco-bus + ¥140 Glacier Park 
 (big) cable car = ¥260 pp. Pick the earliest slot\; the plan is built o
 n being at the visitor centre 08:40 and on the cable car 09:20.\nPREREQU
 ISITE (done at the 11-14 gate): WeChat installed\, real-name verified\, 
 a card bound.\nIF THE GLACIER CAR SELLS OUT: book Yunshanping 云杉坪 
 (¥55\, 3\,200 m) or Maoniuping 牦牛坪 (¥60\, 3\,700 m) instead — 
 lower\, easier\, and day 6 still works. Do not buy a 'guaranteed' third-
 party glacier ticket.\nIF THE FORECAST IS BAD: buy anyway if it is refun
 dable\; day 6's rain alternative swaps the mountain to day 7\, but the r
 eservation is date-locked\, so that swap has to be decided the evening b
 efore.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow 23:00: Yulong cable-car tickets open (7-day release)
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:30 min: Yulong glacier cable car opens — 玉龙雪山服务
  mini-program
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
