SUMMARY:🎻 On the trip: lock day 7's evening and read day 6's sky
DESCRIPTION:20:00 local — you are in Lijiang tonight.\n1. Ask the guest
 house to confirm the Dayan Naxi Ancient Music performance for 11-27 and 
 book two seats (≈¥120–180 pp). The 15–30 November dates came from
  a tourism listing\, not the ensemble — if it is dark\, ask for a Dong
 ba script workshop instead.\n2. Read tomorrow's Yulong forecast. Cloud o
 n the peak makes the ¥140 cable car a ride into white: if it looks bad\
 , swap day 6 and day 7 tonight — the reservation is date-locked and ca
 nnot be moved in the morning.\n3. Confirm the car and driver for 07:50 t
 omorrow\, and that they carry oxygen.\n4. No alcohol tonight. You go fro
 m 2\,400 m to 4\,506 m in twenty minutes tomorrow.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow evening in Lijiang: book the music\, read the mounta
 in forecast
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Now: confirm Naxi music + tomorrow's Yulong forecast + the 07
 :50 car
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
