DTSTART:20261127T180000
DTEND:20261127T183000
SUMMARY:🛫 On the trip: confirm the real departure time and re-run day 
 8
DESCRIPTION:18:00 local — Lijiang\, the night before you fly.\nTHE WHOL
 E OF DAY 8 IS BUILT ON AN ASSUMED 13:30 TAKE-OFF. Confirm the real one n
 ow.\n1. Open the booking (https://www.csair.com/en/ or the agent you use
 d) and read the actual LJG departure time T.\n2. Re-run the formula: T =
  take-off → T−3 h at LJG (international ticket\, the bag is tagged t
 hrough) → T−4 h out of the guesthouse.\n3. Check in online and pick 
 seats.\n4. Book the airport car with the guesthouse for T−4 h (≈¥12
 0\, 28 km\, 40 min). There is no reliable street-hail at the old-town ga
 tes in the morning.\n5. If T is earlier than 11:30\, drop the Black Drag
 on Pool dawn walk and sleep instead — sunrise is 07:47 and the reflect
 ion is not worth a missed flight.\n6. Find the old-town maintenance-fee 
 receipt: Black Dragon Pool asks for it at the gate.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Tomorrow you fly: confirm the real departure time tonight
TRIGGER:-P1D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Now: confirm T\, check in\, book the airport car for T−4 h
TRIGGER:-PT30M
END:VALARM
